hov-qt (1.2.2-1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Music: QQ search true pagination (infinite scroll) via the Desktop protocol
    (grp + numeric page params); works anonymous or logged-in.
  * Music: pagination covers for NetEase/QQ (thumbnail backfill fix); embedded
    cover art on downloaded music (verified with ffprobe attached_pic).
  * Music: CDN node probing for NetEase (m70x 403 workaround) and an mpv event/
    log pump so playback failures are no longer silent.
  * Subtitles: auto-track selection fixes (bare-language fallback for zh/Chinese,
    Bilibili direct route with backoff for 429).
  * Lyrics: adaptive font shrink for long lines (all platforms); macOS music-mode
    background/lyric fix.
  * Quality: "video max height" now actually applied (Linux/Android).
  * Stability: macOS main-thread-only caches (crash fix), keep-open pause race
    hardening, anonymous fallback when QQ login state is stale.

